This product includes software originally developed for a low-latency
market-data transport. The backend interface, the seven backends, the
Ethernet/IPv4/UDP frame builder, the AF_XDP socket wrapper, the DPDK port
setup, the stream framing and the lwIP glue are original work licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The two XDP programs (src/xdp_filter.bpf.c, src/xdp_tcp_filter.bpf.c) are
dual-licensed Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-only: the kernel loads a BPF program
only if it declares a GPL-compatible licence, and Apache-2.0 alone is not.

Third-party components are NOT vendored in this repository; they are fetched
or linked at build time and remain under their own licences. See
THIRD-PARTY.md.
